      "text": "The platform targets IntelliJ IDEA, VS Code, CLI, Desktop JVM, Android, iOS, JS/WASM web, and server runtimes, with distribution via JetBrains Marketplace, VS Code Marketplace, npm, a web app, and GitHub Releases (iOS built from source)."
