      ],
      "text": "The default Gradle build includes mpp-core (shared agent engine with tools, MCP integration, and AGENTS.md loading), mpp-ui, mpp-server (a Ktor-based remote coding agent server), viewer modules, and xiuper support modules, with mpp-idea as a composite build."
